1663.9s 465 Every arm changes the MuRIL component only; the TF-IDF/SVM half of the blend is
1663.9s 466 fixed. `holdout` is the fixed 15% split, 960 rows: it RANKS arms correctly but
1663.9s 467 reads about two points high, measured on Task B. `5-fold` is 6,401 out-of-fold
1663.9s 468 rows, noise about 0.6 points, and is the number to report.
1663.9s 469 
1663.9s 470 `hate_rate` is the predicted positive rate on the holdout; the training prior is
1663.9s 471 0.491 and anything outside 0.10-0.90 has collapsed.
